('suttru:jaipur-jantar', 'Jantar Mantar, Jaipur', 'jaipur-jantar', 'PLACE', 'HISTORICAL', 'Jaipur', 'Rajasthan', 26.9247222, 75.825, 'Explore Jaipur’s historic astronomical observatory and its large instruments.', 'Explore Jaipur’s historic astronomical observatory and its large instruments. Location source: https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1338/maps/. Map pin identifies the site; confirm the entrance or meeting point with the operator.', 'https://www.tourism.rajasthan.gov.in/jantar-mantar.html', 'UNKNOWN', 'UNKNOWN', NULL, 'Rajasthan Tourism', 'https://www.tourism.rajasthan.gov.in/jantar-mantar.html', '2026-10-12 16:14:00', '2026-11-11 16:14:00', 0.9, 1);
